  partName: IntakeManifoldBoltLeft
  description: The IntakeManifoldBoltLeft is a tiny, elongated bolt situated at the
    top-left-front of the engine, playing a vital role in securing the intake manifold
    to the engine block. Its Material.001 composition provides excellent strength
    and durability, while its small size allows it to fit into tight spaces. Notably,
    the IntakeManifoldBoltLeft works in tandem with other bolts to ensure a secure
    and leak-free seal.
